==Phylogeny==

* '''Ambulacraria''' ([[Élie Metchnikoff|Metchnikoff]], 1881) [[total group]]
** †[[Vetulocystida]] ? (Shu ''et al.'', 2004)
** †[[Cambroernida]] (Caron, Conway Morris, & Shu, 2010)
** '''Ambulacraria''' (Metchnikoff, 1881) [[crown group]]
*** [[Echinodermata]] (Bruguière, 1791 [ex Klein, 1734])
**** ([[sea star]]s, [[sea urchin]]s, [[brittle star]]s, [[Holothuroidea|sea cucumber]]s, [[feather star]]s, sea lilies, etc.)
*** [[Hemichordata]] ([[William Bateson|Bateson]], 1885)
**** ([[acorn worm]]s (Enteropnuesta) and [[Pterobranchia]] (including [[Graptolithina]]))<ref>
{{cite journal
|last1=Mitchell |first1=C. E.
|last2=Melchin |first2=M. J.
|last3=Cameron |first3=C. B.
|last4=Maletz |first4=J.
